<title>CANADA: Brick Brewing completes Connors acquisition.</title>
<headline>Brick Brewing completes Connors acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>WATERLOO, Ontario 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brick Brewing Co Ltd said on Tuesday it completed its acquisition from Don Valley Brewing Co Ltd of the trademarks and other rights owned by Connors Brewery for all its line of premium crafted beers.</p>
<p>Brick said it previously announced on December 19, 1996 it had signed a binding agreement with Connors for the acquisition.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
